  "description": "A small generic behavior tree for SetNet AI: Sequence / Selector / Parallel composites, Inverter / Succeeder / Repeater / Cooldown decorators, and Action / Condition / Wait leaves, assembled with a fluent builder and ticked over your context type. Engine-agnostic; wrap one in an IMobBrain for mob AI, or use it anywhere. No wire protocol. Depends only on SetNet.",
